cosmic-ext-classic-menu (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Menus made of blocks: build the menu in the layout editor from the
    user, search, applications, side panel, power, quick launch, spacers
    and dividers, each with options of its own.
  * The six layouts are presets of blocks; existing settings are migrated.
  * Right-click menu on the panel button, with entries chosen and
    reordered in the settings.
  * Hibernate power action, and a choice of the power actions shown.
  * Spacers in the places panel.
  * Choose where on the screen the focused menu opens.
  * Settings split into pages, with the layout editor next to the block
    options.
  * New settings translated into all languages.

 -- Kamil Lihan <k.lihan@outlook.com>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

cosmic-ext-classic-menu (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New Whistler layout: a start page with favorite and recently used
    applications, leading to all applications.
  * Quick launcher type: favorites can be shown in place of the recently
    used apps.
  * Choose the category the menu opens on.
  * Column or grid view of applications in any layout.
  * Drag applications onto the favorites, or into the dock to pin them.
  * --toggle option to open or close the menu.
  * Fixed icons given as a path to a PNG image, and a crash with PNG based
    icon themes.

 -- Kamil Lihan <k.lihan@outlook.com>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
